      "readme": "This dataset contains structural (T1w) and functional MRI data from participants performing three tasks:\n- Response task\n- Feature task\n- Dimension task\n\nAcquisition parameters:\n- Scanner: Siemens Magnetom Prisma 3T\n- Functional TR: 2.0s, voxel size: 3mm isotropic\n- T1w: 1mm isotropic\n\nParticipants:\n- Healthy young adults (N = 53)\n- Excluded 11 participants from the analysis (final N = 42)\n\nNotes:\n- Localizer scans were excluded from the BIDS dataset.\n- All functional runs used the AP phase-encoding direction.\n",
